\newlabel{fig:frontier}{{6}{12}{\rev {Diversity--precision frontier of promoted edges over the $(\text {budget},\alpha )$ grid. Each point is an operating policy, colored by budget; the $y$-axis is enrichment against the external ENCODE reference and the $x$-axis is source evenness. External precision is nearly flat across the grid, so the automatically selected point (star: budget 200, $\alpha =0.05$) achieves far higher diversity than the fixed 842-edge budget (diamond) at no precision cost.}}{figure.caption.23}{}}
